\frac{5}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | $2$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | $1$ | $2$ | {{field-1}} |\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"completing-a-row-of-a-table-using-the-abm-2-step-method\"></a>"}]}
